 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "再看提币这一头，最要紧的是签名服务。",
   "spoken": "再看提币这一头，最要紧的是签名服务。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg4-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 5.271
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "签名服务只认请求的格式对不对。",
   "spoken": "签名服务只认请求的格式对不对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg4-01.wav",
   "start": 5.74,
   "dur": 2.4,
   "speechStart": 5.74,
   "speechEnd": 7.983
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "攻击者如果能伪造上游数据，它就会按正常流程，签出攻击交易。",
   "spoken": "攻击者如果能伪造上游数据，它就会按正常流程，签出攻击交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg4-02.wav",
   "start": 8.36,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 8.453,
   "speechEnd": 13.66
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "2026 年 9 月，Bitget 被盗约 3.875 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "2026 年 9 月，Bitget 被盗约 3.875 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg4-03.wav",
   "start": 14.02,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 14.126,
   "speechEnd": 18.592
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "公开报道称，攻击者利用第三方安全产品的零日漏洞，拿到了内部高权限凭证。",
   "spoken": "公开报道称，攻击者利用第三方安全产品的零日漏洞，拿到了内部高权限凭证。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg4-04.wav",
   "start": 18.96,
   "dur": 6.8,
   "speechStart": 19.055,
   "speechEnd": 25.511
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "再向钱包后台，插入伪造的提现指令。",
   "spoken": "再向钱包后台，插入伪造的提现指令。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg4-05.wav",
   "start": 25.98,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speechStart": 25.98,
   "speechEnd": 29.354
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "项目方称，已经排除了私钥泄露。",
   "spoken": "项目方称，已经排除了私钥泄露。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg4-06.wav",
   "start": 29.72,
   "dur": 2.72,
   "speechStart": 29.72,
   "speechEnd": 32.257
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "一个月后，Binance 出事，按它的初步报告，路径是这样的。",
   "spoken": "一个月后，Binance 出事，按它的初步报告，路径是这样的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg4-07.wav",
   "start": 32.66,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 32.754,
   "speechEnd": 37.08
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "6 月，一名工程师下载了被篡改的 Homebrew。",
   "spoken": "6 月，一名工程师下载了被篡改的 Homebrew。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg4-08.wav",
   "start": 37.52,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 37.611,
   "speechEnd": 40.965
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "那一次已被发现并处置，报告没有确认之后一直有访问。",
   "spoken": "那一次已被发现并处置，报告没有确认之后一直有访问。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg4-09.wav",
   "start": 41.42,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 41.42,
   "speechEnd": 45.945
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "9 月，另一名工程师运行了一份假的面试作业。",
   "spoken": "9 月，另一名工程师运行了一份假的面试作业。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg4-10.wav",
   "start": 46.36,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 46.36,
   "speechEnd": 50.115
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "10 月 20 日，攻击者经过这台电脑和内部 AI 工具，又控制了另外两台电脑。",
   "spoken": "10 月 20 日，攻击者经过这台电脑和内部 AI 工具，又控制了另外两台电脑。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg4-11.wav",
   "start": 50.58,
   "dur": 5.84,
   "speechStart": 50.58,
   "speechEnd": 56.207
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "其中一台上，存着容器部署令牌。",
   "spoken": "其中一台上，存着容器部署令牌。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg4-12.wav",
   "start": 56.64,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 56.64,
   "speechEnd": 59.59
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "10 月 29 日，攻击者用它部署容器，运行恶意脚本，访问内部签名服务。",
   "spoken": "10 月 29 日，攻击者用它部署容器，运行恶意脚本，访问内部签名服务。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg4-13.wav",
   "start": 59.98,
   "dur": 6.8,
   "speechStart": 59.98,
   "speechEnd": 66.595
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "攻击者不需要私钥，它让签名服务替它签。",
   "spoken": "攻击者不需要私钥，它让签名服务替它签。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg4-14.wav",
   "start": 67.0,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 67.094,
   "speechEnd": 70.557
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "以太坊上，签出的是 EIP-7702 委托，把热钱包账户的代码，指向攻击者的合约。",
   "spoken": "以太坊上，签出的是 EIP-7702 委托，把热钱包账户的代码，指向攻击者的合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg4-15.wav",
   "start": 70.98,
   "dur": 7.84,
   "speechStart": 71.075,
   "speechEnd": 78.593
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "其他链上，就是普通的签名转账。",
   "spoken": "其他链上，就是普通的签名转账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg4-16.wav",
   "start": 79.04,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 79.13,
   "speechEnd": 81.494
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "决定性的一环，是开发终端上的长期部署令牌。",
   "spoken": "决定性的一环，是开发终端上的长期部署令牌。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg4-17.wav",
   "start": 81.9,
   "dur": 4.16,
   "speechStart": 81.9,
   "speechEnd": 85.904
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "它把一台电脑失陷，变成了生产环境失陷。",
   "spoken": "它把一台电脑失陷，变成了生产环境失陷。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg4-18.wav",
   "start": 86.28,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 86.28,
   "speechEnd": 90.084
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-19",
   "text": "签名流程本身被驱动了，冷热隔离和私钥保护，都挡不住。",
   "spoken": "签名流程本身被驱动了，冷热隔离和私钥保护，都挡不住。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg4-19.wav",
   "start": 90.5,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 90.5,
   "speechEnd": 95.345
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-20",
   "text": "防线有三条。",
   "spoken": "防线有三条。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg4-20.wav",
   "start": 95.76,
   "dur": 1.44,
   "speechStart": 95.76,
   "speechEnd": 96.99
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-21",
   "text": "签名服务独立核对，目标地址和金额，必须对得上账本里的提现订单。",
   "spoken": "签名服务独立核对，目标地址和金额，必须对得上账本里的提现订单。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg4-21.wav",
   "start": 97.42,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 97.518,
   "speechEnd": 103.22
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-22",
   "text": "部署令牌要短期有效、绑定设备，还要第二个人批准。",
   "spoken": "部署令牌要短期有效、绑定设备，还要第二个人批准。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg4-22.wav",
   "start": 103.64,
   "dur": 4.16,
   "speechStart": 103.73,
   "speechEnd": 107.628
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-23",
   "text": "风控引擎和签名服务，由不同的团队维护。",
   "spoken": "风控引擎和签名服务，由不同的团队维护。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg4-23.wav",
   "start": 108.02,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 108.02,
   "speechEnd": 111.533
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-24",
   "text": "两起事件，都还没有最终的第三方调查报告。",
   "spoken": "两起事件，都还没有最终的第三方掉查报告。",
